  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Precision in motion.",
    "overview": "The user-confirmed charcoal/lime reference replaces the earlier light-only pearl/blue direction. Large Manrope type, compact portrait, rounded panels and one rotating silver sculpture frame factual career content.",
